====Pronoun====
'''sää'''
# {{context|personal|dialectal|colloquial|lang=fi}} (''in [[Häme]] dialect'') [[you]] (''addressing one person; in archaic English'': [[thou]]).
#:*''[[mikä|Mitä]] '''sää''' [[tehdä|teet]]?''
#:**''What are '''you''' doing?''

